"""
backend/app/services/dataset_service.py
========================================
Dataset management service layer.

All file I/O and analytics computations happen here.
The router calls these functions and receives Pydantic-ready dicts.

Design principles
-----------------
* All statistics are computed from actual file contents — nothing hardcoded.
* Raw files in ml/datasets/raw/ are never modified.
* Processed files in ml/datasets/processed/ are generated by the pipeline.
* The catalog describes known datasets; availability depends on disk state.
* Upload saves to ml/datasets/raw/ with a sanitised filename.
* Export returns processed CSVs as byte streams — only processed data,
  never the raw dataset text (copyright).
"""

